# {{projectName}}: Architecture

Style: **{{architecture.style}}**

## Layers

```
src/
  presentation/controllers/     request handling, no business logic
  application/services/         one method per use case
  domain/entities/              business state and rules
  domain/value-objects/         immutable values
  domain/repositories/          repository interfaces (ports)
  infrastructure/persistence/   repository implementations (adapters)
  composition-root.ts           wires concrete classes together
```

Dependencies point inwards only: presentation → application → domain ← infrastructure.
The domain layer must not import from any other layer.

