## Implementation rules

1. Keep every file in the layer it was generated in; add new files to the matching folder.
2. Implement each `TODO(Dev)` and keep the `// UC-XXX` comments for traceability.
3. Name tests after the use case they cover, e.g. `describe('UC-001: ...')`.
4. Design docs live in `docs/` (use cases, domain model, class and sequence diagrams).
